  "description": "The native payload for Agora's voice effects and beautification extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. The voice changers, equalisation presets and room-reverb effects — the chipmunk voice, the concert-hall reverb, the \"studio\" polish on a plain microphone. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.SetVoiceBeautifierPreset / SetAudioEffectPreset in the RTC binding.",
